---
description: "Cursor overlay for Next.js App Router files. Canonical rules live in AGENTS.md."
globs:
  - "app/**/*.ts"
  - "app/**/*.tsx"
  - "components/**/*.tsx"
  - "lib/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md` for this stack.

When editing matching files:

- Default to React Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Validate external input with Zod before use.
- Keep route handlers and pages thin; put logic in `lib/` or server actions.
- Never invent secrets; read from validated env (`lib/env.ts`).
- Prefer Prisma typed queries over raw SQL unless there is a clear reason.
